WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.918
- The best (beep)
organization in the world.

00:00:02.918 --> 00:00:04.380
- [Eddie] And what is that?

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.370
- (beep) Proud Boys.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:06.403
- [Eddie] Hell yeah.

00:00:06.403 --> 00:00:07.236
- [Man] Whose streets?

00:00:07.236 --> 00:00:08.069
- [Marchers] Our streets!

00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:08.902
- [Man] Whose streets?

00:00:08.902 --> 00:00:09.756
- [Marchers] Our streets!

00:00:09.756 --> 00:00:10.589
USA! USA!

00:00:12.357 --> 00:00:14.030
- [Narrator] One of the
most prominent groups

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:17.360
to storm the Capitol on
January 6th was the Proud Boys,

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.910
a right-wing extremist group

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:21.750
whose members describe themselves
as Western chauvinists.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.989
- [Eddie] The Proud
Boys are takin' over DC.

00:00:23.989 --> 00:00:24.970
(dramatic instrumental music)

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:25.940
- [Narrator] The Wall Street Journal

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:27.950
analyzed hundreds of videos from the riot,

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:30.060
social media posts, court filings,

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.040
and interviewed participants in the events

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.990
and experts on extremism in
an effort to piece together

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:37.670
the most complete picture
of the Proud Boys' role

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.745
in the events that day.

00:00:39.745 --> 00:00:41.885
- [Marchers] USA! USA!

00:00:41.885 --> 00:00:43.202
USA! USA!

00:00:43.202 --> 00:00:44.417
USA! USA!

00:00:44.417 --> 00:00:47.420
(beep) Antifa! (beep) Antifa!

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:48.640
- [Narrator] The Journal's investigation

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.050
shows Proud Boys coordinating, instigating

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.200
and leading some of the
most pivotal moments

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.180
of the rush into the historic building

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.000
that disrupted lawmaker certification

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.640
of the presidential election

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.900
and resulted in the death of five people,

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.420
including one police officer.

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:07.003
(rioters shouting overlaps)
- Let's go!

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:09.320
- [Narrator] About seven Proud Boys

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:12.240
have been arrested so far for
their actions at the Capitol,

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:15.600
more than any other right-wing
group there that day.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:17.947
Proud Boy chairman Enrique
Tarrio told The Journal,

00:01:17.947 --> 00:01:19.787
"The Proud Boys didn't
coordinate their actions

00:01:19.787 --> 00:01:21.650
"or intend to storm the Capitol,"

00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:23.900
and many of the threats
that The Journal pointed out

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:25.360
were meant as a joke.

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:27.760
He also said the Proud
Boys don't condone violence

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:29.527
unless in self-defense.

00:01:29.527 --> 00:01:30.360
- [Man] Move!

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:31.220
- [Marchers] Move!

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:33.010
- [Narrator] Tarrio wasn't
at the Capitol that day

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:34.780
because he was arrested days before

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:36.560
and charged with destruction of property

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:38.629
and was banned from the city.

00:01:38.629 --> 00:01:40.935
(tense music)
(marcher chattering overlaps)

00:01:40.935 --> 00:01:41.768
- [Man] Whose streets?

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:42.810
- [Narrator] The Proud Boys first earned

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:44.730
mainstream attention when President Trump

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:46.340
didn't denounce white supremacists

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:47.610
and right-wing militia groups

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:49.430
in a September presidential debate.

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:52.730
- Proud Boys, stand back and stand by,

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:54.820
but I'll tell you what,
I'll tell you what,

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:57.770
somebody's gotta do something
about Antifa and the left.

00:01:57.770 --> 00:01:59.350
- [Narrator] The moment
emboldened the group.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:00.870
Its leader, Enrique Tarrio,

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:03.200
posted a message on
social media shortly after

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:06.150
saying simply, "Standing by sir."

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.770
It has been widely reported that the group

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.650
planned to attend a rally at
the Capitol on January 6th

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.760
to protest election results.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.280
Joe Biggs, another leader,

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:16.163
called for violence on social media.

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:19.533
- [Eddie] All right guys, you
wanna see all the Proud Boys

00:02:19.533 --> 00:02:20.950
that are here today?

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:21.783
Here we go.

00:02:21.783 --> 00:02:22.616
Everybody cover up!

00:02:22.616 --> 00:02:23.660
- [Narrator] On the day of the event,

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:26.550
more than 100 Proud Boys from
around the country were there.

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:27.383
- Montana!

00:02:28.997 --> 00:02:30.235
- 406!

00:02:30.235 --> 00:02:31.068
- Idaho!

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:33.460
- [Eddie] Like his channel.

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:35.450
- [Narrator] A Proud Boy live
streamer named Eddie Block

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:38.580
extensively filmed the group
as they met and coordinated.

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:39.950
- I know, right?

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:41.330
- [Narrator] Block declined to comment.

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:42.910
- I know, exactly.

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:43.743
- [Narrator] In the morning,

00:02:43.743 --> 00:02:46.150
before a rally near the White
House with President Trump,

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:48.750
the Proud Boys meet on the
east side of the Capitol.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:54.010
Biggs can be seen organizing
groups of Proud Boys.

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:55.593
He's equipped with a radio.

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:58.275
- [Joe] If you're on the outside,

00:02:58.275 --> 00:03:00.160
makin' sure you're looking on
the outside of the perimeter,

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.510
no one's sneakin' up on us.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.610
- [Narrator] Biggs has since been arrested

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:07.000
and charging documents
say he aided, abetted,

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:09.960
and commanded others to
unlawfully enter the Capitol.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.790
- [Eddie] The big boss man, Joe Biggs.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:12.623
- [Narrator] Biggs and his attorney

00:03:12.623 --> 00:03:15.540
did not respond to multiple
requests for comment.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.780
- Milkshake's afraid of me
'cause I'm gonna kick his (beep).

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:19.910
- [Narrator] Dan Scott, a
Proud Boy known as Milkshake,

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:21.508
can be heard shouting.

00:03:21.508 --> 00:03:23.160
- [Dan] Let's take the (beep) Capitol!

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:24.222
- [Man] Come on, tighten up.

00:03:24.222 --> 00:03:25.160
Tighten up, tighten up.
- Come on, boys.

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:26.200
- [Man] Tighten up, tighten up!

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:28.080
- [Narrator] But is chastised by others.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:29.380
- None of that.

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:31.653
Let's not (beep) yell that, all right?

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.732
- It was Milkshake, man. He knows.

00:03:34.732 --> 00:03:37.493
(Eddie laughs)

00:03:37.493 --> 00:03:38.483
Idiot.

00:03:38.483 --> 00:03:40.540
- [Dan] Don't yell it, do it.

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:41.730
- [Narrator] Scott did not respond

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:43.380
to multiple requests for comment.

00:03:44.501 --> 00:03:46.280
- [Men] (beep) Antifa!

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.220
- [Narrator] Some individuals,

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:49.480
who would hours later
participate in the riot,

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:51.733
can be seen taking part in the rendezvous.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:54.400
There's Michael Porter

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:57.270
who identified himself to
The Journal as a Proud Boy.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:00.120
This man, whose identity The
Journal could not fully confirm

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:03.240
in interviews, social media
searches and court documents,

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.320
can be seen with the
group throughout the day,

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.523
instigating the mob.

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:08.650
And Robert Gieswein,

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:10.290
who's also with the
group throughout the day

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.230
and is wearing patches
suggesting affiliation

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:14.143
with Proud Boys and right-wing groups.

00:04:15.477 --> 00:04:17.023
- [Eddie] (laughs) I
gotta get one of these.

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:18.950
- [Narrator] Rallied by Biggs

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:21.730
and another leader, Ethan
Nordean, known as Rufio,

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:24.810
the Proud Boys coalesce
and march on the Capitol.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:26.313
Nordean declined to comment.

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:30.240
- [Eddie] Two men on a mission

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:33.278
with about 500 behind them,
ready to kick some butt

00:04:33.278 --> 00:04:34.901
and stand up for this country.

00:04:34.901 --> 00:04:37.401
(tense music)

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:40.963
- [Cameraman] Saw the
Proud Boys comin' in.

00:04:41.992 --> 00:04:43.280
- [Narrator] At around 12:50 p.m.,

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:46.170
while President Trump has taken
the stage at a nearby rally,

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:48.330
another live streamer
captures the Proud Boys

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:50.350
approaching the Capitol from the northwest

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:52.100
and encountering a small police presence

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.653
behind a temporary barrier.

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:56.368
- [Crowd] We love Trump!

00:04:56.368 --> 00:04:58.100
We love Trump!

00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.700
- [Narrator] Biggs
huddles with an individual

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.699
in a red hat and carrying a flag.

00:05:01.699 --> 00:05:02.756
- [Crowd] We love Trump!

00:05:02.756 --> 00:05:04.040
We love Trump!
- So basically...

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:05.609
- [Man] Yeah, kill the speech.

00:05:05.609 --> 00:05:07.517
(crowd cheering)

00:05:07.517 --> 00:05:08.760
- [Narrator] Who just minutes later

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.820
is the first to charge the barriers.

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:13.790
(crowd shouting overlaps)

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:14.675
- [Man] Someone hold my pack.

00:05:14.675 --> 00:05:15.795
Hold my backpack.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:05:15.795 --> 00:05:17.159
- Hold my backpack.

00:05:17.159 --> 00:05:20.429
(crowd shouting overlaps)

00:05:20.429 --> 00:05:24.128
(fencing clatters)
- USA! USA!

00:05:24.128 --> 00:05:27.628
(crowd shouting overlaps)

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:33.640
- [Narrator] Proud Boys
can be seen in the crowd.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.360
Porter told The Journal that
he participated in a protest,

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:39.229
not a riot, and that he
did not enter the Capitol.

00:05:39.229 --> 00:05:40.471
(crowd shouting overlaps)

00:05:40.471 --> 00:05:42.400
- [Man] Stop them! Storm the Capitol!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.890
- [Narrator] The few police officers there

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:45.523
quickly fall back.

00:05:47.009 --> 00:05:48.810
And the Proud Boys make up a large portion

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:51.669
of the first wave to reach
the base of the Capitol.

00:05:51.669 --> 00:05:54.778
- [Man] They're rushing the
(beep) Capitol, brother!

00:05:54.778 --> 00:05:57.887
The Proud Boys are rushin' the Capitol!

00:05:57.887 --> 00:06:01.387
(crowd shouting overlaps)

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:05.880
- [Narrator] Proud Boys are
among those who square off

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:07.984
with Capitol Police at
the base of the building.

00:06:07.984 --> 00:06:10.677
(tense music)

00:06:10.677 --> 00:06:13.911
(crowd shouting overlaps)

00:06:13.911 --> 00:06:15.875
- [Man] We just took the US Capitol.

00:06:15.875 --> 00:06:16.810
- [Narrator] Dominic Pezzola,

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:19.350
a Proud Boy and military
veteran known as Spazzo

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:21.563
is on the frontlines
with a wire in his ear.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.240
Pezzola's attorney told The Journal

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:26.810
his client did not coordinate
his actions with anyone

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:30.057
and that the radio earpiece
was for listening to music.

00:06:30.057 --> 00:06:31.175
(crowd shouting overlaps)

00:06:31.175 --> 00:06:32.675
- [Woman] Traitor!

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:36.323
- [Narrator] This man,

00:06:36.323 --> 00:06:38.350
who continues to be seen
with the Proud Boys,

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:40.380
appears to be directing members of the mob

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:42.798
to the left side of the police line.

00:06:42.798 --> 00:06:44.317
- Come back at the
standing, grab a brother.

00:06:45.394 --> 00:06:47.930
(crowd shouting overlaps)

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:49.284
- [Narrator] He then leads a chant.

00:06:49.284 --> 00:06:50.763
- [Man] Whose country is this?

00:06:50.763 --> 00:06:52.371
- [Crowd] Our country!

00:06:52.371 --> 00:06:53.713
- [Man] Whose house is this?

00:06:53.713 --> 00:06:55.100
- [Crowd] Our house!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:56.474
- Do you want your house back?

00:06:56.474 --> 00:06:57.307
- [Crowd] Yes!

00:06:57.307 --> 00:06:58.140
- Take it!

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.683
- [Narrator] Gieswein is nearby.

00:07:00.651 --> 00:07:02.740
- [Protester] Take it!

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:03.728
- [Man] What now?

00:07:03.728 --> 00:07:06.000
[Narrator] Nordean, Biggs,
and other leadership

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.270
also take prominent
places on the frontline

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:09.671
near the Capitol steps.

00:07:09.671 --> 00:07:12.171
(tense music)

00:07:13.299 --> 00:07:15.740
(crowd chattering overlaps)

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:17.781
- Look at (beep), thinks they're hard!

00:07:17.781 --> 00:07:18.800
But they're-

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:20.730
- [Narrator] A protracted
battle between rioters

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:22.520
and outnumbered police ensues

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:25.400
and Proud Boys like Pezzola

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:29.071
can be seen throughout key
parts of the confrontation.

00:07:29.071 --> 00:07:31.150
(crowd shouting overlaps)
- (beep) you!

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:33.483
(beep) you!

00:07:35.692 --> 00:07:37.310
- [Man] (beep) you!

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:38.930
- [Narrator] Around 1:37,

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:41.973
Gieswein tries to push
through the police barriers.

00:07:41.973 --> 00:07:44.490
- [Man] Can't push us, patriots!

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:45.480
- [Narrator] And an hour later,

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:48.423
rioters try to flank the
police by climbing scaffolding.

00:07:49.486 --> 00:07:52.618
(rioter shouting overlaps)

00:07:52.618 --> 00:07:53.940
- [Man] Go!

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:56.240
- [Narrator] Pezzola
takes part in the charge.

00:07:57.233 --> 00:07:58.722
- [Man] (beep) you!

00:07:58.722 --> 00:08:00.152
(beep) you!

00:08:00.152 --> 00:08:02.000
(beep) you!

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.160
- [Man] We takin' this (beep).

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:04.730
- [Narrator] And Gieswein sprays police

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:06.601
with an unidentified substance.

00:08:06.601 --> 00:08:09.230
(tense music)

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:12.030
Gieswein was arrested for
assaulting a federal officer,

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:13.690
destruction of government property,

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:16.740
entering a restricted area,
and disrupting Congress.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:18.740
Gieswein's attorney declined to comment.

00:08:19.763 --> 00:08:21.339
(crowd shouting overlaps)
(glass clattering)

00:08:21.339 --> 00:08:22.172
- [Man] They're breakin' the window!

00:08:22.172 --> 00:08:23.100
- [Narrator] At around 2:12,

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:26.100
Pezzola breaks a window to the
Capitol with a police shield.

00:08:27.125 --> 00:08:30.420
- Go, go, go, go, go!
- Let's go!

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:31.550
- [Narrator] He and Gieswein

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:34.833
are among the first rioters
to enter the building.

00:08:34.833 --> 00:08:38.131
(crowd shouting overlaps)

00:08:38.131 --> 00:08:39.503
- [Man] Go!

00:08:39.503 --> 00:08:41.410
(Dominic shouting)

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.560
- [Narrator] Pezzola was
arrested on January 15th

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:46.160
for unlawful entry, destruction
of government property,

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:49.044
and obstruction of an official proceeding.

00:08:49.044 --> 00:08:52.928
- [Dominic] Let's go!
(rioter shouting overlaps)

00:08:52.928 --> 00:08:54.905
- [Man] Hey, where're
they countin' the votes?

00:08:54.905 --> 00:08:56.313
(beep) where do they count the votes?

00:08:56.313 --> 00:08:57.910
- Put it down!
- Where they countin'?

00:08:57.910 --> 00:08:58.940
- [Narrator] Inside the Capitol,

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:01.643
a crowd of rioters encounter
Officer Eugene Goodman.

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:05.038
They follow him up a set of stairs.

00:09:05.038 --> 00:09:06.140
- Second floor!

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:08.290
- [Narrator] Coming perilously
close to the lawmakers

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.400
who are just down the hall

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.348
through the doorway to
the left of Goodman.

00:09:11.348 --> 00:09:12.809
(tense music)

00:09:12.809 --> 00:09:14.983
(crowd shouting overlaps)

00:09:14.983 --> 00:09:17.133
Pezzola and Gieswein are in the crowd.

00:09:19.915 --> 00:09:22.620
- [Rioter] This is ours!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.440
- [Narrator] Entering the
building close behind is Biggs.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:26.741
- [Woman] (beep) you!

00:09:26.741 --> 00:09:27.925
- [Cameraperson] Biggs,
what you gotta say?

00:09:27.925 --> 00:09:29.243
- This is awesome.

00:09:29.243 --> 00:09:30.076
(rioters shouting)

00:09:30.076 --> 00:09:32.070
- [Tyler] It's over!

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:33.140
- [Narrator] Around the same time

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:34.310
at the base of the building,

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:37.410
the police line is breaking apart

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.806
and crowds storm more entrances.

00:09:39.806 --> 00:09:42.556
(crowd cheering)

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.860
At larger groups of rioters
breach the building,

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:48.453
parts of the Proud Boys
contingent make it inside.

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:51.660
Nicholas Ochs,

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:54.480
leader of the Hawaii chapter
of the Proud Boys, was arrested

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:57.880
after boasting about entering
the Capitol on social media.

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:00.150
Ochs and his attorney declined to comment.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:01.780
- I'm right here.
- Onwards!

00:10:02.797 --> 00:10:04.700
- [Narrator] According
to the charging documents

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:08.080
for Miami Proud Boy, Gabriel
Garcia, he roamed the Capitol

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:11.820
calling for Nancy Pelosi to
quote, "Come out and play."

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:14.350
A lawyer for Garcia said that
he did not damage property

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:16.070
or commit violence at the Capitol.

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:18.010
His comments about Pelosi were in jest

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:20.398
and he wants nothing to
do with the Proud Boys.

00:10:20.398 --> 00:10:22.717
(tense music)

00:10:22.717 --> 00:10:23.587
- [Man] Ho!

00:10:23.587 --> 00:10:24.945
- [Man] Ho!

00:10:24.945 --> 00:10:25.778
Ho!

00:10:25.778 --> 00:10:26.611
- [Narrator] Since the riot,

00:10:26.611 --> 00:10:29.160
Proud Boys leadership has
tried to downplay their role.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:30.760
But The Journal's investigation

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:33.640
shows that at every key breach
of the Capitol's defenses,

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:35.830
the Proud Boys and members
of their contingent

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:37.350
are at the forefront of the mob

00:10:37.350 --> 00:10:39.713
and can be seen coordinating
and instigating.

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:43.410
Authorities have arrested
about seven Proud Boys so far

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:45.350
for their role in the attack.

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:48.010
Other Proud Boys have
threatened more violence.

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:50.304
- Take this as a shot across the bow.

00:10:50.304 --> 00:10:52.830
Like, next time we come armed.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:53.740
- [Narrator] Porter told The Journal

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:55.660
he made this statement as an individual,

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:58.540
not as a representative of the Proud Boys.

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:01.320
Proud Boy leadership was
unapologetic about the violence

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:03.272
in a live stream after the riots.

00:11:03.272 --> 00:11:06.080
- I've answered reporters
for the past week

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:08.691
that keep saying, "Well,
the Proud Boys planned this

00:11:08.691 --> 00:11:10.311
and this is (beep) up."

00:11:10.311 --> 00:11:12.200
And they've told me to denounce it.

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:14.040
Listen, I'm not gonna denounce anything.

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:14.910
I do understand-

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:15.900
- [Narrator] Tarrio told The Journal

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.850
that his and Biggs' comments in this show

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.730
were expressing the
views of Trump supporters

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:21.800
who have felt marginalized by the system.

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:23.380
- It's only going to get worse

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:25.170
and that's what people don't understand,

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:28.490
is the more you push the bear,
the more you poke the bear,

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:30.514
the bear is going to (beep) come back.

00:11:30.514 --> 00:11:33.014
(tense music)

